5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry about relying on external conditions. Let's check what actually happened before.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,We should look at past records. Repeating mistakes is inefficient.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,Staff capacity is the real bottleneck. I need to see who is actually available.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,The budget structure matters more than the total. I will examine the funding terms.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am concerned about access. Where we are located changes who can come.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, do you think looking at old data will help us avoid new pitfalls?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, absolutely. History is the best predictor of failure.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,I will check the volunteer register. We need to know our actual skills.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will look at the county grant terms. The shape of the money is key.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I will check the bus links. If they are gone, we are isolated.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will look at the winter road closures. Weather always disrupts plans.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the two programmes from six years ago. We need to see what failed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will also check the neighbourhood associations. They might have the skills we lack.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will also check the running and equipment lines. I need to see the overruns.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will also check the evening room bookings. I need to see when people actually come.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Thanks, everyone. Let's see what the data says.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. Facts over feelings.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,Let's proceed.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,Understood.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
