60,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Option D seems best. It handles the road closures and reaches the outer wards.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Option B is a repeat of the failed digitisation project. I oppose it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option A needs tool certification. We don't have the technician. Option D is safer.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,Option D uses the equipment slack. The grant covers the staff. It’s financially sound.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option D solves the access problem. The bus links are gone, so we must go to them.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, can we find a new technician for Option A?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, it’s risky. The old project failed because of lack of follow-through.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, Option D doesn't need a technician. It needs a driver. We have that.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, correct. The running costs are high, but we have the equipment budget.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, the remote use peaks at night. Option D can’t do that, but it’s better than nothing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I’m voting for D. It’s the most resilient and accessible.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’m voting for D. It avoids the pitfalls of B and A.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shion,,I’m voting for D. It’s the most logical choice given our constraints.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,I’m voting for D. The funding structure supports it.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’m voting for D. It reaches the people who need us most.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Yumi,,It seems we are all in agreement.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. The data supports it.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,Let’s proceed.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Minako,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
